## 6. File Upload Flow

1. User selects a file in the UI
2. Upload via REST: `POST /api/v1/chat/files/upload`
3. Get back `{ file_url, file_name, file_size, content_type }`
4. Send a FILE message with the URL:

```typescript
const handleFileUpload = async (file: File, roomId: string) => {
  // Step 1: Upload to S3
  const uploadResult = await uploadFile(file);

  // Step 2: Send as FILE message via WebSocket
  stompClient?.publish({
    destination: '/app/chat.send',
    body: JSON.stringify({
      room_id: roomId,
      type: 'FILE',
      body: uploadResult.file_name,
      file_url: uploadResult.file_url,
      file_name: uploadResult.file_name,
      file_size: uploadResult.file_size,
      file_content_type: uploadResult.content_type,
    }),
  });
};
```

